SUMMARY:Leggetid + kveldslesing BUD1: kap. 1\, s. 4–28 + kap. 2\, s. 29
 –40
DESCRIPTION:I seng kl. 20:00\, lys av 21:00. Les sidene til morgendagens BU
 D1-økt (hopp over Assessment material – oppgavene tar du på sal):\ns. 
 5 The users of accounting information\ns. 6 Differences between management
  accounting and financial accounting\ns. 7 The decision-making\, planning 
 and control process\ns. 11 The impact of the changing business environment
  on management accounting\ns. 19 Focus on customer satisfaction and new ma
 nagement approaches\ns. 22 Functions of management accounting\ns. 23 Summa
 ry of the contents of this book\ns. 26 Summary\ns. 27 Key terms and concep
 ts\ns. 30 Cost objects\ns. 31 Manufacturing\, merchandising and service or
 ganizations\ns. 31 Direct and indirect costs\ns. 35 Period and product cos
 ts\ns. 37 Cost behaviour
CATEGORIES:BUD1READ
END:VEVENT
